(text "CAN2 default standby; LIN2 commander assembly, default sleep. MCU enables and schedules bus.\nOnly one commander pullup per LIN bus. Remove BOTH D1502/R1507 for responder-only assembly.\nCAN2 uses PB5/PB6; SENT3 uses PE11 pad74. Shared timer, CAN filters and firmware remain pending.\nNo automotive pulse/ESD/EMC or fault qualification is implied by this candidate." (at 25.4 335 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "703f49fb-0c6b-5fd1-97f5-a99913bbd373"))
